    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すげぇ、すげぇ！
何、これ、超すげぇじゃん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa whoa whoa, that was
amazing! What even was that!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だしょ～。当店自慢の
『ムービープレイヤー・クロス』は
世界で1つしかないからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ri~ght? It's this shop's pride and joy,
the "Movie Player: Cross"!
There's only one like it in the world!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269372</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今まで見たものだったら、
いつでも見られるから、
遊びに来てね～∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Anything you've seen up till now,
I can show you whenever you
like! So please come, anytime~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>俺、来る！
また、絶対来るから！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, I will! 100%!
You can count on it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
